config BR2_PACKAGE_APRILTAG_DEMO
    bool "apriltag live demo"
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_DISPLAY
    select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENCV4
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBMMZ
    select BR2_PACKAGE_VVCAM
    select BR2_PACKAGE_APRILTAG
    help
        Two live on-device AprilTag applications with identical camera,
        grayscale preprocessing, and DRM display paths:

        - apriltag_demo: the apriltag-rvv Rust detector
        - apriltag_c_demo: the official AprilRobotics C detector

        The Rust static library must be built first in the rvv-dev docker
        image (package scripts/build_rust_lib.sh).
